/* Pf028 - Rhino joins > 10k face polysurfaces in O(n^2) (K028)
   Rhino exposes "Do not join polysurfaces with more than ___ faces"
   as an explicit configuration cutoff - admission of a scale-related
   defect class. Nested blocks with deep hierarchies trigger constant
   warnings. Trigger: AP242 file with assembly depth > 10 OR a single
   body with > 10000 faces.
   This fixture combines both:
   - assembly nesting depth ~10 via NEXT_ASSEMBLY_USAGE_OCCURRENCE chain
   - one body with many faces (16 here, replicate to >10000 to trigger).
   Scaling-up: replicate the ADVANCED_FACE pattern to >10000 children of
   a single CLOSED_SHELL and the NAUO chain to >10 levels. */
ISO-10303-21;
HEADER;
FILE_DESCRIPTION(('Pf028 - Rhino-scale join threshold: deep + wide'),'2;1');
FILE_NAME('Pf028.stp','2026-04-26T00:00:00',('auto-generated'),(''),
  'auto-generated','','');
